# Static-analysis configuration, pinned by the 2026-08-12 QC sweep so
# future runs reproduce the adjudicated check set. Exclusions, with the
# reasoning of record (PLAN.md Resolved log):
#  - misc-include-cleaner: header-hygiene noise on foreach_target TUs
#    (every -inl.h is deliberately included per target).
#  - bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: kernel signatures are
#    positional by design (a, b, x span triples mirror the math).
#  - misc-use-anonymous-namespace: per-target kernels and dispatch
#    entries use `static` instead (the paired internal-linkage check is
#    satisfied); HWY_EXPORT references qualified names and static is
#    the smaller structural change than nesting anonymous namespaces
#    inside HWY_NAMESPACE.
# Added by the 2026-10-10 sweep (clang-tidy 23.1.2, PLAN.md status):
#  - bugprone-exception-escape: fires on test/example main(); a throw
#    there is a crash, which is the intended test failure.
#  - bugprone-random-generator-seed: fixed seeds are deliberate, for
#    reproducible test and bench inputs.
#  - bugprone-signed-bitwise: `rc |=` exit codes, int64_t{1} << k table
#    constants, and (k & 1) parity of non-negative loop counters.
#  - performance-enum-size: test/bench enums; no measurable value.
Checks: '-*,bugprone-*,performance-*,portability-*,misc-*,-misc-include-cleaner,-bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,-misc-use-anonymous-namespace,-bugprone-exception-escape,-bugprone-random-generator-seed,-bugprone-signed-bitwise,-performance-enum-size'
WarningsAsErrors: ''
FormatStyle: none
